            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You siphon spell energy into one weapon you're wielding. Until the end of your turn, the weapon deals an extra 1d6 damage of a type depending on the school of the spell you just cast.\n\n\u2022 Abjuration force damage\n\u2022 Conjuration or Transmutation the same type as the weapon\n\u2022 Divination, Enchantment, or Illusion mental damage\n\u2022 Evocation a type the spell dealt, or force damage if the spell didn't deal damage\n\u2022 Necromancy negative damage"
            }
          }
